  "description": "FreeType rasterizer backend for KernSmith. Runs on Windows, Linux x64, macOS, and Android (not iOS, where it fails to link). Renders color fonts (COLRv0/CPAL, CBDT, sbix; COLRv1 glyphs as grayscale), variable fonts, SDF, font hinting (bytecode with autohint fallback), and every anti-alias mode including Light and LCD.",
